                <pb facs="0188" n="70" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg70"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure No.
                    2—Telegram—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Barbosa to Mr. Valente.</hi></head>
                <p>Government is constituted in Republic of the United States of Brazil. Monarchy
                    deposed; imperial family left the country; provinces adhere; tranquillity and
                    general satisfaction; executive power intrusted to Provisional Government, whose
                    chief is Marshal Deodoro da Fonseca, and myself the minister of finance;
                    Republic respects strictly all engagements and contracts entered upon by the
                    State.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ruy Barbosa</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister of Finance.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
